      "implementation": {
        "current": "Persistent title/body/notebook/tag notes, revisions, saved-version history and trash; supported JEX metadata retains original IDs, dates, geolocation, author/source URL, to-do fields and raw relationships. A single atomic state record commits related metadata; attachment bytes are prepared before commit with rollback cleanup.",
