# New To-do standalone cloud proposal

The 25-file proposal is frozen in `copy-authority-v3.json` (9,803 bytes, SHA256 bf09b19451d439836aa84db52be04f32e4fe9314896d8fd90562170a457f5ce2). Its source-data audit is 394 bytes / 9cae5b4f54af1ed6fba103cf0eab0cb031c4ca055e82f148bac4e089fe719f80. All candidate paths are new; no active repository files or Git state were changed by this agent.

The exact R4 application remains frozen under `../notes-new-todo-r4-next`: 12 original proposal files, seven app overlay targets, 19 added groups. The separate source experiment will compose the seven targets only in ephemeral hosted checkouts. It selects 21 files/111 groups, preserves all old17 tests and separates old20/new4/new2 original helper/command comparisons. Eight browser cases require three success response holds, one genuine failure hold, two owned I/O faults with exact restoration, two real downloads, eight PNGs, eight synthetic state records and complete cleanup. No actual run or acceptance exists yet.

