# Current36 committed-source boundary, phase1

Exact inputs are frozen by `phase1-authority.json`. This is source-only work. The helper has not been imported, syntax-checked or run. The7 app after-images are identical to actual successful R5 run38930449217 and repeat38932306725; no installation is performed.

The new helper is `products/rea-studio/scripts/verify-notes36-installed-cloud.mjs`. Its `declarationSource` is a literal external pin for the60,830-byte current-source-declaration. The declaration lists the other59 proof rows only; helper itself, collector and current workflow are not pinned by the declaration. It contains36 app identities,7 exact transition records, the frozen R5 bundle/authority/peer,21 fixed test files,23 old+19 new names, separate20/4/2 comparisons and exact old52/56 historical logical-to-physical maps. The combined60 proof objects total695,900 bytes, bounded64/8MiB/256KiB individually. The declaration is the largest object60,830B. The current source proof is separate from the closed12-tooling table and old52/56 historical readers.

Exported APIs for the standalone collector:

- `assertHosted()`: requires GitHub-hosted Windows/X64, Node24.16.0, repository identity, actual HEAD==GITHUB_SHA, SHA1 Git, clean checkout and either `finite-twenty-one-file-selection` or `eight-real-chromium-scenarios`; Git-authenticates helper itself. No overlay is admitted.
- `execution()`:10 strings, including GITHUB_JOB. Remove only that declared field when comparing unchanged acquisition's9-field receipt.
- `ownedEvidence(path)`, `saveJSON`, `saveBytes`, `evidenceBytes`, `safe`, `readSource`, `gitSource`, `git`, `identity`, `sourceLimits`: bounded equivalents of the already reviewed experiment utilities. Evidence/data stay in owned RUNNER_TEMP. Source limits remain2000 files/64MiB aggregate/8MiB individual/depth32.
- `proof()`: authenticates the external declaration and other59 literal rows to current Git bytes, validates exact36 app names,7 target/after images and3 before images, every fixed21 test and frozen payload review/original dependency; returns `{declaration,bundle,captured,readFiles:60,readBytes,fileLimit:64,byteLimit:8MiB,currentSources,sourceInputs}`. `bundle` is the immutable historical R5 JSON, used as fixed roster/data only; its original32-baseline/workflow pointers are not dereferenced as installed contracts.
- `activeCensus()`: full six roots (`apps,lib,public,browser-tests,scripts,tests`) with established exclusions/extensions plus server/catalog/package. `authenticateCensus(rows,declaration)` closes the entire name set to the actual Git tree and authenticates every byte/blob, no excluded targets; reports34 eligible Notes sources,36 app files,7 installed targets/6 eligible, sourceOverlay:false. Counts of other source files are derived from that committed tree.
- `readInstalled(evidence)`: verifies `notes36-source-check.json`, `notes36-source-before.json`, same attempt, exact fresh proof and same full census; returns `{declaration,bundle,receipt,value,current,before,after:before,root}`. `value.authentication.sourceAuthentication` is the full Git census authentication. The collector must use that nested field, not the experiment's `composedSourceAuthentication`. `receipt` is the before JSON's exact bytes/SHA.
- `verifyPostcheck(evidence,installation)`: verifies independent helper `notes36-postrun-source-check.json` and `notes36-source-after.json`, same before receipt, current proof, stable census, no overlay/mutation/executions; returns the postcheck JSON identity.

The helper's CLI is `--phase before|after --evidence ABSOLUTE_OWNED_PATH`. `before` captures60 complete source objects under `notes36-proof-source/`, a full census and a distinct unexecuted source-check receipt. `after` independently repeats proof/census, binds before and writes source-verified or failed evidence. The workflow must always run `after` for every started before check, including product failure; a missing/failed before receipt must fail, never skip to acceptance.

Evidence may author the new `verify-notes36-cloud.mjs` and `.github/workflows/notes-new-todo-installed-cloud.yml` only in its own assigned work subtree after parent authorization. Do not edit this frozen helper/declaration/subset. The old experiment collector is a source template only: use this installed API and distinct schema/filenames, `sourceOverlay:false`, no composition, no excluded Git target, actual committed-source acceptance wording. Preserve finiteResults/browserResults semantics and all111/21/23+19/20+4+2/8/3+1holds/2fault-restores/2downloads/8cleanup validators. Reuse exact unchanged R5 spec/config/roster and their literal pins, acquisition package/lock/metadata/default config/FlowVault source, unchanged shared acquisition command and original clock/native evidence restrictions. The new fixed12 tooling rows substitute helper/declaration/new workflow for composer/bundle/old workflow; collector self is separately Git-bound. The new workflow must not contain a literal pin for the collector that pins it, avoiding a hash cycle.

Owner boundaries: Notes agent owns7 app images, declaration/helper, migration/producer/controls and final copy authority. Evidence, if authorized, owns only new standalone collector/new workflow and their work-only documentation. Archive independently reviews all boundaries. Existing old helper/composer/collectors/receipts remain unchanged. The old2 automatic workflows will be retired only as part of the reviewed atomic current36 replacement; their complete before snapshots are already frozen in this subset.
# Narrow architecture budget addendum â€” proposed95 outer roles

The original architecture/R2 and their authorities remain unchanged. Their94-role number was a forecast. Parent review selected a separate95th collector-self snapshot rather than putting a13th decoded source in the12-row tooling envelope. This addendum changes no application source, runtime, acceptance assertion, file/byte cap or prior receipt.

The exact old92 roles are derived by a header-only read of the independently verified actual publication ZIP from run38932318654/artifact12059343380 (branchd24, actual tested merge5f23). `publication-artifact-role-plan.json` names all95 proposed paths: retain those92, including a newly versioned historical56 envelope at the existing old envelope filename, and add exactly:

1. `notes36-current-sources.json.gz.snapshot` â€” exact60 proof sources,64-row/8MiB aggregate and256KiB individual source bounds; externally pinned declaration plus other59, with4MiB stored/8MiB decoded envelope limits.
